            "text": "[{\"id\":\"1d7b8754-2718-4993-b340-b89e50f7c282\",\"organization\":\"City School\",\"designation\":\"Math Teacher\",\"start_date\":\"2026-02\",\"end_date\":\"\",\"responsibilities\":\"Planned and delivered engaging mathematics lessons aligned with curriculum objectives. Simplified complex concepts into clear, understandable explanations to improve student comprehension and performance. Assessed student progress regularly through tests, assignments, and class participation, providing constructive feedback for improvement. Managed classroom behavior effectively to maintain a focused learning environment. Prepared lesson plans, worksheets, and exam-oriented practice material. Supported students individually to address learning gaps and build confidence in problem-solving. Maintained communication with parents and administration regarding student progress and performance.\",\"association\":\"full_time\"}]"
          },
